  "summary": "VPLS (Virtual Private LAN Service) with full mesh of pseudowires between 3 PEs. All attached customer sites appear on ONE bridged L2 segment; BUM traffic replicated via the PW mesh. LDP signalling (RFC 4762) or BGP auto-discovery (RFC 4761). Predecessor to EVPN.",
